TypeScript practices skill for Claude Code and Codex

This directory contains material adapted from the typescript-pro skill in
Jeffallan/claude-skills (https://github.com/Jeffallan/claude-skills), path
skills/typescript-pro, at commit 36f3fe8052da7c57083783268c6ea3265d075265.
